# Deploy PAWCAT after updates

Remote: `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/PAWCAT.git`  
Live site: `https://neversmile0825.github.io/PAWCAT/`

Whenever you finish meaningful website changes in this project:

1. Commit the relevant files (ask only if the user previously said not to commit).
2. `git push origin main` (or the current tracking branch).
3. Confirm the GitHub Pages deploy workflow succeeds (`gh run list` / `gh run watch`), or that branch Pages is up to date.
4. Tell the user the live URL so they can verify.

Do not force-push to `main` unless the user explicitly asks.
